<p>Lay a trap armed with potent venom.  A creature passing over it will be dealt <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">239, 283, 316, 345, 370</acronym> nature damage and be stunned and poisoned for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">24, 28, 32, 34, 37</acronym> nature damage per turn for 4 turns.</p>